## Curated builds

Reviewed against patch 2.1.67 on 2026-08-02. The live patch is 2.2.16a, so these have not been re-read against it yet.

### Roam Favor Reset (Roam)

- Items: Demon Boots, Flask of the Oasis, Fleeting Time, Oracle, Athena's Shield, Immortality
- Core: Flask of the Oasis, Fleeting Time, Oracle
- Emblem: Support Emblem with Agility, Pull Yourself Together, Focusing Mark
- Battle spell: Purify
- Blessing: Favor
- Flex: Dominance Ice over Athena's Shield when Use when enemy sustain or attack-speed carries keep fighting through the first healing cycle.; Antique Cuirass over Athena's Shield when Use against physical skill burst from assassins or fighters that dive straight onto Estes.; Radiant Armor over Athena's Shield when Use against repeated magic poke or burn rather than a single mage burst combo.; Guardian Helmet over Immortality when Use when recalls are costing objective control and the enemy cannot instantly punish the missing revive.
- Total cost: 10750 gold

Default ranked Estes setup built around Favor, Flask, ultimate resets, and enough self-survival to cast Purify before the heal window is cancelled.

### Roam Anti-Sustain Aura (Roam)

- Items: Tough Boots, Flask of the Oasis, Dominance Ice, Enchanted Talisman, Oracle, Immortality
- Core: Flask of the Oasis, Dominance Ice, Enchanted Talisman
- Emblem: Support Emblem with Agility, Wilderness Blessing, Focusing Mark
- Battle spell: Flicker
- Blessing: Favor
- Flex: Magic Boots over Tough Boots when Use when the enemy has low crowd control and faster Moonlight Immersion cycles matter more than Fortitude.; Glowing Wand over Dominance Ice when Use when the enemy healers or shielders can avoid Dominance Ice range and need Lifebane applied by Domain of Moon Goddess. The two Lifebanes do not stack, so take the one that reaches them.; Athena's Shield over Oracle when Use when a burst mage can delete Estes before Oracle's self-healing value matters.; Antique Cuirass over Oracle when Use when repeated physical skill damage is reaching Estes through the front line.
- Total cost: 10610 gold

Close-range utility setup for sustain mirrors where Estes must live in Dominance Ice's Lifebane aura range to suppress enemy healing.

### Roam Revitalize Deathball (Roam)

- Items: Demon Boots, Flask of the Oasis, Fleeting Time, Enchanted Talisman, Oracle, Guardian Helmet
- Core: Flask of the Oasis, Fleeting Time, Enchanted Talisman
- Emblem: Support Emblem with Agility, Pull Yourself Together, Focusing Mark
- Battle spell: Revitalize
- Blessing: Favor
- Flex: Tough Boots over Demon Boots when Use when crowd control is the only reliable way the enemy can stop the deathball heal cycle.; Dominance Ice over Guardian Helmet when Use when the enemy also plays heavy healing, shielding, or attack-speed carries in front-to-back fights.; Athena's Shield over Guardian Helmet when Use when magic burst threatens Estes before Revitalize and Blessing of Moon Goddess can overlap.; Immortality over Guardian Helmet when Use once late death timers decide the game and a revive is worth more than map sustain.
- Total cost: 11050 gold

Grouped five-man setup for drafts that fight around one protected core and can stack Revitalize with Estes' ultimate before the enemy disengages.

